": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/593723055_937043755588825_8237967228736405151_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=W-rqid6i65IQ7kNvwHmchDO&_nc_oc=Adq2AvV7UWlEJWrJELZfbLdZA12Uw4cPy5tLJ38nt4ZxNIWb6JphYkuTVsI3i-6lOHs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQxIhKh8TqO1pQIDg2De3bEPxkIakKQhgPn1tCHPUENaA&oe=6AF717A5"}]}, "id": "939619115856397", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "screenshot.png", "id": "1580743536857374", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/593887116_1580743540190707_9086296718457579085_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=40UM2Jfsck0Q7kNvwHNZbhP&_nc_oc=AdpHY5FfoJOTbwB1J0Utfr4ORLvcjiO4zVuccPtwgq3O7omAUeSB7kazzX4r9smbsIY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRiEiIRPdzaFXfbma5eW0Tmh57YVYb5i_-MfZbeNYy5kQ&oe=6AF73884"}, {"file_name": "Image Sequence_008_0001.png", "id": "2458128298047141", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623585_2458128301380474_3458140855349387352_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3EL0Pyx8YzwQ7kNvwEEY8uz&_nc_oc=AdqTTIF1BLQ8_0fyYzg4TLbJ3zeHA0REYBtKu25bkqa-EtEfGuvTKjQDGJc5q0aOr9c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQToH-GvGDtseVKTQCaxGEwEcGZo0cHyzZrdqoGqoKid2Q&oe=6AF712FE"}, {"file_name": "Image Sequence_003_0001.png", "id": "941658268370303", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/593832569_941658271703636_2607492116305233897_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=D1Fo906C7b4Q7kNvwG61Lg2&_nc_oc=AdqCKDFc46y-YOWH4n081salUzQYMfccqNtcRtkzP5hHa5YAT1ZCm5Q-KpZlFRt46vk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRR5au9bR2C7i-HesXuR8re6Uerexs3p6Gy4kkMyRnH0w&oe=6AF715B2"}, {"file_name": "Image Sequence_005_0001.png", "id": "1945868106085552", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/593902063_1945868112752218_1209217684030245071_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=va_ZZ2NFtu8Q7kNvwFSeSSs&_nc_oc=Adp9DEzMrvcDTENkANS4pCkdVrFQ8wljncdhqah0uKhNaLzNiEfd2e5E8epXkTRDTjQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSwG7FyBvUjm0AyuL42XNIBCzZr5pBADvLMTK5Cao7KrA&oe=6AF72A33"}, {"file_name": "Image Sequence_002_0001.png", "id": "1097016086080277", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/593849888_1097016089413610_7284588337456586763_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=v2ckgky5OQYQ7kNvwEaoSau&_nc_oc=AdokkXokd8Bai4EhROeWwkj24cBFhRwLXVy7TCuID0HAlvq5zPE3xSoOz-49nBFnfJk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTXXL319QbEibQ2JL7dgcv-hct1ea92y-UtrnoA-pcA8A&oe=6AF72E8D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Greenhouse Monster", "keywords": ["horror", "simulation", "warehouse", "greenhouse"], "long_description": "You took the night shift because the pay was good. Nobody told you what walks the aisles after dark.\n\nWelcome to your first shift at the greenhouse warehouse. The job sounds simple: read the order on your terminal, walk to the right shelf, punch in the keypad code, pack the item, seal the crate, and ship it before your daily quota runs out. Miss quota, and you're done.\n\nBut you're not alone in here.\n\nHUNTED IN THE DARK\nSomething stalks the warehouse floor. You'll never hear it coming from a clean direction \u2014 just footsteps that grow louder as it closes in. Kill your flashlight, drop into a crouch, and slip under the shelving. If it spots you, it screams and charges. Your only edge is knowing where it can't reach you.\n\nRUN \u2014 BUT NOT FOREVER\nSprinting drains your stamina fast. Push too hard and you're stuck walking, wide open, while the bar refills. Every escape is a gamble on how much you've got left in the tank.\n\nWORK UNDER PRESSURE\nThis isn't just hide-and-seek. You have a job to do. Match every order to the correct shelf, solve the symbol keypad, pack the right item, and get it shipped clean. Ship the wrong thing or leave a crate unsealed and you lose the payout \u2014 and burn precious time you don't have.\n\nSPEND TO SURVIVE\nEarn money and spend it at the shop \u2014 a flashlight to cut the dark, a scanner to work faster, an oxygen capsule to buy yourself a second chance. Every purchase is a bet on what keeps you alive longer.\n\nEVERY NIGHT GETS WORSE\nHigher quotas. Tighter margins. A", "short_description": "Clock in for the night shift \u2014 if you survive it. Read the order, find the shelf, crack the keypad, pack the crate, and ship it before quota runs out. But something is hunting the aisles. Kill your flashlight, crouch under the racks, and hold your breath as it stalks past. A tense VR warehouse horror where every order pushes you deeper into the dark. Can you hit quota before it hits you?"}]}, "developer_name": "JB Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/vrprivacy/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "JB Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/vrprivacy/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "644354873106712"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE", "SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1078812031196879"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 3, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1801022074481328"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1478946160729513"}, {"status": "PUBLISH